\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. WALK in the light: so shalt thou know
\par That fellowship of love
\par His Spirit only can bestow,
\par Who reigns in light above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Walk in the light: and thou shalt find
\par Thy heart made truely His,
\par Who dwells in cloudless light enshrined,
\par In whom no darkness is.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Walk in the light: and thou shalt own
\par Thy darkness passed away,
\par Because that Light hath on thee shone,
\par In which is perfect day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Walk in the light: and e'en the tomb
\par No fearful shade shall wear;
\par Glory shall chase away its gloom,
\par For Chrst has conquered there.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Walk in the light: and thine shall be
\par A path, though thorny, bright;
\par For God, by grace, shall dwell in thee,
\par And God Himself is Light.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

